	<section_number>15.2-5936</section_number>
	<catch_line>Creation of Authority</catch_line>
	<text>
		There is hereby established a body corporate and politic known as the Hampton Roads Regional Arena Authority. The Authority is a political subdivision of the Commonwealth.
	</text>
